@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ArrowColor Black
skinparam ActorBorderColor Black
skinparam UsecaseBorderColor Black
skinparam RectangleBorderColor Black
skinparam ClassBorderColor Black

left to right direction
rectangle "Game chạy trong iframe" as Game
rectangle "Game SDK v2" as SDK
rectangle "Host App Bridge" as Bridge
rectangle "Backend API" as API
database "Database" as DB
queue "WebSocket Hub" as WS
rectangle "Command chính" as CMD {
  [shareScore]
  [unlockAchievement]
  [createRoom]
  [joinRoom]
  [syncState]
}
Game -right-> SDK : command
SDK -right-> Bridge : postMessage
Bridge -right-> API : REST API
API -right-> DB : lưu dữ liệu
API -down-> WS : phát sự kiện
WS -left-> Bridge : realtime event
Bridge -left-> SDK : response/event
SDK -left-> Game : callback
SDK -down-> CMD : đóng gói lệnh
@enduml
